# Studio UI shell

## Topbar order (Browse + Edit)

Left cluster must stay:

1. Logo (`/logo.png`)
2. Product name `svg3dx Studio`
3. `SettingsMenu` (gear icon only)
4. Page action: Browse →「编辑当前文件」; Edit →「返回浏览」

Do not put Settings only on one page. File name / status / export / save stay to the right of that cluster.

Edit page may place a centered「视图 / View」menu (toggle Model / Source panels) between the left cluster and the right actions. Do not put view toggles inside Settings.

## Settings menu

- Trigger: TDesign text square button + `SettingIcon`
- Popup contents only:
  1. Language (`zh` / `en`)
  2. Color scheme (`light` / `dark`)
- Reuse `@/components/SettingsMenu.vue`; do not revive a separate language-only control in the topbar

## Skeletons

Loading skeletons for Browse/Edit must mirror the same topbar structure (brand → settings → page action → right actions).
